   "title": "Furbearers Are Now Required to Register Their Harvest Online (NHFG news, Aug 27, 2026)",
   "url": "https://nhfishgame.com/2026/08/27/furbearer-hunters-are-now-required-to-register-their-harvest-online/",
   "type": "agency_news",
   "notes": "Online registration of hunter-harvested furbearers mandatory since 2025 (within 24 hours); fisher sealing + lower-jaw submission."
  }
